  - CHANGELOG.md
learnings:
  - 'The settlement-debt case is structurally impossible IF settleParentIfComplete always fires — so detecting it surfaces a real bug (a settlement that should have happened but didn''t), not just a hygiene nicety. A detect-only board field is the right shape: it makes the anomaly visible without a risky auto-repair.'
  - Calibration actuals are captured PER-AGENT during the run (recordEstimateActual), so T-013's re-attribution protects the LEARNING loop (work-log/journal promotion to the right notebook), not calibration bands directly — worth being precise about which loop a 'claimant accuracy' fix actually guards.
